{
    "title": "Jurassic Front: Exploration",
    "description": "The evil Zacha army is ambitiously attempting to dominate Tusk Island where various dinosaurs existed. With powerful military and advanced technology, they are continuously expanding their territory in this \"jurassic world\". As the commander, you will lead the survivors to capture and remodel primal dinosaurs, train armies, form alliances, conquer cities, and liberate the jurassic world occupied by the Zacha army on this dangerous yet opportunity-filled jurassic park  step by step.\r\n\r\n----------FEATURES----------\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd95[Free Exploration and Resource Collection] \r\nExplore freely on the jurassic island; every corner may hide unexpected surprises, whether it's forgotten treasures, rare resource points, or a variety of primal dinosaurs in the jurassic park , all waiting for you to discover in this jurassic world game. During exploration in the jurassic park base, gradually discover and unlock misty maps that open up more unknown areas in this thrilling dinosaur hunting game.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd95[Wild Hunt and Capture Dinosaurs] \r\nHundreds of primal jurassic dinosaurs can be encountered everywhere on the large jurassic wilderness. The unique jurassic world  \r\ngameplay allows you to experience the thrill of catching dino beyond your expectations! Engage in the dinosaur hunting game and captured dino can be advanced, equipped with mecha, and genetically strengthened. Come capture the primal dino and witness the birth of  jurassic killing machine\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd95[Real-Time Teamfight with Thousands of Players] \r\nJoin forces with allies and lead the troops, creating a battlefield where thousands of troops with mecha dino engage at the same time! Participate in various Legion Battles like Tusk City Battle for more resources and construct your territory on the \" jurassic world \". Unlock foggy areas step by step and experience unique dinosaur fighting games.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd95[Deploy Your Troops and Outsmart Opponents] \r\nPersonalized compositions of mecha dinosaur, various soldier-dino combinations, and unique unit counter relationships, all work together to depict a brain-burning  strategic jurassic world game. The grand siege scenes of giant dinosaur fighting present a full-scale, realistic 3D grand scenario of giant dinosaur strategic warfare and dinosaur fighting game!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd95[Construct Your Base and Build Your Immortal Empire] \r\nCollect resources with dinosaur, construct the base, develop resources, arrange all the built buildings and decorations as you wish, and build your own exclusive territory city in your style within the  jurassic park.\r\n\r\n----------FOLLOW US----------\r\nFacebook:https://www.facebook.com/JurassicFront4X/",
    "descriptionHTML": "The evil Zacha army is ambitiously attempting to dominate Tusk Island where various dinosaurs existed. With powerful military and advanced technology, they are continuously expanding their territory in this &quot;jurassic world&quot;. As the commander, you will lead the survivors to capture and remodel primal dinosaurs, train armies, form alliances, conquer cities, and liberate the jurassic world occupied by the Zacha army on this dangerous yet opportunity-filled jurassic park  step by step.<br><br>----------FEATURES----------<br><br>\ud83e\udd95[Free Exploration and Resource Collection] <br>Explore freely on the jurassic island; every corner may hide unexpected surprises, whether it&#39;s forgotten treasures, rare resource points, or a variety of primal dinosaurs in the jurassic park , all waiting for you to discover in this jurassic world game. During exploration in the jurassic park base, gradually discover and unlock misty maps that open up more unknown areas in this thrilling dinosaur hunting game.<br><br>\ud83e\udd95[Wild Hunt and Capture Dinosaurs] <br>Hundreds of primal jurassic dinosaurs can be encountered everywhere on the large jurassic wilderness. The unique jurassic world  <br>gameplay allows you to experience the thrill of catching dino beyond your expectations! Engage in the dinosaur hunting game and captured dino can be advanced, equipped with mecha, and genetically strengthened. Come capture the primal dino and witness the birth of  jurassic killing machine<br><br>\ud83e\udd95[Real-Time Teamfight with Thousands of Players] <br>Join forces with allies and lead the troops, creating a battlefield where thousands of troops with mecha dino engage at the same time! Participate in various Legion Battles like Tusk City Battle for more resources and construct your territory on the &quot; jurassic world &quot;. Unlock foggy areas step by step and experience unique dinosaur fighting games.<br><br>\ud83e\udd95[Deploy Your Troops and Outsmart Opponents] <br>Personalized compositions of mecha dinosaur, various soldier-dino combinations, and unique unit counter relationships, all work together to depict a brain-burning  strategic jurassic world game. The grand siege scenes of giant dinosaur fighting present a full-scale, realistic 3D grand scenario of giant dinosaur strategic warfare and dinosaur fighting game!<br><br>\ud83e\udd95[Construct Your Base and Build Your Immortal Empire] <br>Collect resources with dinosaur, construct the base, develop resources, arrange all the built buildings and decorations as you wish, and build your own exclusive territory city in your style within the  jurassic park.<br><br>----------FOLLOW US----------<br>Facebook:https://www.facebook.com/JurassicFront4X/",
